From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 05:18:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Reuse a validated tree on the master push CI instead of
 rerunning every gate

A full, whole-acceptance-map PR or manual CI run records its tree as an
artifact. The master push run looks for that exact tree and, on a trusted
hit, skips the product jobs as scope mode 'reused' while keeping the
push/master/exact-SHA run and its ci-required job for the release gate.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015bNTyVEePFDSAzBKU87s8f
